      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Ben, who was that girl you had a meal with yesterday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：她叫小雨，我的朋友。",
