      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: How did you get to know each other?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：在书店，丽丽介绍我们认识的。",
      "traditional": "本：在書店，麗麗介紹我們認識的。",
